An unclosed fence after an attribute line in a container ends at its closer

````
::: note
{#x}
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <pre id="x"><code>code
::::
</code></pre>
</aside>
<p>after <strong>b</strong></p>
````

